# Add public environment variables here
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# --- Adsterra ad zone snippets ---
# All zones below are live/Active in the Adsterra dashboard for
# sanu-world.onrender.com. Provider tag is fixed to 'adsterra' since every
# slot uses the same network.

# Top banner (728x90) — also reused for Bottom banner below.
